### Parcours d'API — Module 1 (compatible IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
@host = http://localhost:8080
@base = {{host}}/api/v1

### 1. Inscription patient (un OTP est affiché dans les logs)
POST {{base}}/auth/register/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marie.dupont@example.com",
  "phone": "+33612345678",
  "password": "Azerty123",
  "firstName": "Marie",
  "lastName": "Dupont",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-12",
  "gender": "F"
}

### 2. Confirmer l'OTP recu par email (code visible dans les logs)
POST {{base}}/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target": "marie.dupont@example.com",
  "code": "384921",
  "channel": "EMAIL"
}

### 3. Connexion
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marie.dupont@example.com",
  "password": "Azerty123"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.tokens.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.tokens.refreshToken}}

### 4. Profil connecte
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Activer la MFA TOTP
POST {{base}}/auth/mfa/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Sessions connectees
GET {{base}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Inscription praticien (RPPS de test : 11 chiffres ou TEST*)
POST {{base}}/practitioners/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dr.dupont@example.com",
  "phone": "+33611112233",
  "password": "Azerty123",
  "firstName": "Jean",
  "lastName": "Dupont",
  "specialty": "Cardiologie",
  "rppsNumber": "10001234567",
  "adeliNumber": "123456789",
  "iban": "FR7630001007941234567890185"
}

### 8. Deposer une piece (diplome, RIB, assurance, contrat)
POST {{base}}/practitioners/me/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

DIPLOMA
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="diplome.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./diplome.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 9. Accepter le contrat electronique d'adhesion
POST {{base}}/practitioners/me/contract
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "2026-09",
  "contentHash": "sha256:abc123"
}

### 10. Inscription etablissement
POST {{base}}/establishments/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cabinet@example.com",
  "phone": "+33699998877",
  "password": "Azerty123",
  "legalName": "Cabinet medical du Parc",
  "siret": "81234567800012",
  "address": "10 rue des Medecins, Paris",
  "departments": ["Cardiologie", "Imagerie"]
}

### 10bis. Lister les etablissements (pour connaitre leur user.id)
GET {{base}}/establishments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10ter. Demander un rattachement a un cabinet (multi-etablissements)
# establishmentUserId accepte le user.id du compte ESTABLISHMENT ou l'id de establishment_profiles
# role : OWNER | EMPLOYEE | REPLACER (optionnel, EMPLOYEE par defaut)
POST {{base}}/practitioners/me/memberships
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "establishmentUserId": 1,
  "role": "EMPLOYEE",
  "validFrom": "2026-10-03",
  "validUntil": "2027-10-03"
}

### 11. Connexion super-admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@prdv.app",
  "password": "Admin#2026!"
}

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.tokens.accessToken}}

### 12. Dossiers praticiens en attente de validation
GET {{base}}/admin/practitioners/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. Valider un dossier praticien
POST {{base}}/admin/applications/2/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "reason": "RPPS, diplome, RIB, assurance et contrat verifies"
}

### 14. Creer une secretaire rattachee au praticien #2
POST {{base}}/practitioners/secretaries
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "secretaire@example.com",
  "firstName": "Julie",
  "lastName": "Martin",
  "supervisedPractitionerIds": [2],
  "permissionCodes": ["agenda.read", "appointment.write", "appointment.cancel"]
}

### 15. Delegation temporaire de droits
POST {{base}}/delegations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "granteeUserId": 2,
  "permissionCodes": ["billing.read"],
  "reason": "Absence du gerant",
  "validFrom": "2026-09-12T08:00:00Z",
  "validUntil": "2026-09-19T20:00:00Z"
}

### 16. Journal d'audit
GET {{base}}/admin/audit?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. Donnees analytics anonymisees
GET {{base}}/admin/analytics/anonymized-users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 18. Rafraichir les jetons (rotation)
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 19. Deconnexion
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 20. Patient : profil, eligibilite KYC paiement et profils mineurs rattaches
GET {{base}}/patients/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/patients/me/kyc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/patients/me/minors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Lucas",
  "lastName": "Martin",
  "birthDate": "2016-05-14",
  "gender": "MALE"
}

###
GET {{base}}/patients/me/minors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

